{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12202480","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12202480","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1220248001:0":{"text":"이건... 물? 엄청 깨끗해... 이렇게 깨끗한 물은 본 적이 없어!","source_cn":"是……水？好干净……我从没见过这么干净的水！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54B9B2A6153BD011","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1220248002:0":{"text":"저, 저리 비켜! 나부터 마셔볼게!","source_cn":"让、让开！让我先喝一口！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F32536804E32D65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1220248003:0":{"text":"아, 안돼, 나도 아직 덜 마셨어!","source_cn":"不、不行——我还没喝够！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD4D0C2788C1B2DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1220248004:0":{"text":"이게 진짜라니, 깨끗하고 단맛도 나는 물이 진짜라니! 헛소리가 아니었어!","source_cn":"竟然是真的，干净的，还带点甜味的水！我真的不是在做梦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E3DB30E75BCE8B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1220248005:0":{"text":"형씨, 자네!","source_cn":"兄弟，你——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC981309829E32414","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1220248006:0":{"text":"어라? 당신은 백련 공방의 후긴!? 멀리서 당신 얼굴을 본 적이 있어요!","source_cn":"咦？你是百炼工坊的呼金？！我远远望见过你的脸！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5AF8D4E5AD44E00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1220248007:0":{"text":"아아, 저, 저도 기억나요. 꺼억, 후, 후긴이었군요! 제 총을 수리해 주었잖아요!","source_cn":"啊啊，我、我也认得，嗝，是、是呼金！他还帮我修好过枪！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x682BEFA962CB13B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1220248008:1":{"text":"다, 다, 다행이에요. 정말 감사합니다!","source_cn":"太、太、太好了，太感谢您了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA217E58D75CFB44A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1220248009:1":{"text":"거참, 멀쩡한 젊은이가 왜 말을 하다 말고 울어...?","source_cn":"嚯，好好的小伙子怎么说着说着就哭了呢……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2ECBA641826E9CB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1220248010:1":{"text":"우리도 술을 마시는 게 안 좋다는 건 알고 있어요! 월터도 우리를 몇 번이나 설득했지만, 술 말고는 마실 수 있는 게 없어서...","source_cn":"我们也知道喝酒不好！沃尔特那家伙劝了我们好多次，但我们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D3F21ED826FEF20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1220248011:1":{"text":"제대로 된 물이 있다면 우리도 더 이상... 꺼억! 이제 매일 술에 취해있지 않아도 돼요!","source_cn":"如果真能有水用，我们就不用再……嗝！每天醉醺醺的了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5EADC363857109BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1220248012:1":{"text":"우, 우리가 술 한잔 사겠습니다!","source_cn":"要、要不，我们请您也喝一杯！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2775D3AF17D3D72","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1220248013:1":{"text":"그래요, 가장 비싼 걸로 드시죠. 오늘 먹고 이제 우린 술을 끊을 겁니다!!","source_cn":"是，我们请您喝吧，喝最贵的，我们以后绝对戒酒了！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA865CAD39AD33D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1220248014:1":{"text":"허, 금주는 좋은 일이지! 그 돈은 아껴두도록 해!","source_cn":"嚯，戒酒是好事哇！你们那点钱自己留着吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x625CB13525BA7D8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1220248015:1":{"text":"예예, 분부대로 합지요!\n형제들, 어서 집에 있는 수도관을 다시 제자리에 돌려놓자고!","source_cn":"是是是，都听您的！\\n哥们几个，走，把家里的管子都找出...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBED140ABB79F8B28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1220248016:0":{"text":"허, 대체 얼마나 많은 수도관을 훔친 거야...?","source_cn":"嚯，这帮人到底偷了多少管子啊……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1D01922D2C1ADD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:27:1220248016":{"text":"허, 대체 얼마나 많은 수도관을 훔친 거야...?","source_cn":"嚯，这帮人到底偷了多少管子啊……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1D01922D2C1ADD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1220248017:1":{"text":"느낌? 느낌은... 휴, 뭐라고 해야 할지...","source_cn":"感想？感想就是……唉，不知道怎么说……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x693190C776F0ED17","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"느낌? 느낌은... 휴, 뭐라고 해야 할지...","female":"느낌? 느낌은... 휴, 뭐라고 해야 할지...","variant_male_record_index":"135049","variant_female_record_index":"135050","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1220248020:1":{"text":"오늘은 여기까지 하지. 난 처리할 일이 좀 있어. 내일 아침 일찍 소니아의 사무실에서 만나지.","source_cn":"今天就到这吧，我还有点私事要处理，明早在索尼娅办公的地方见。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6670A1D36EF6A230","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1220248021:1":{"text":"간다!","source_cn":"走了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD1F1DCCD8AE2642","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1220248022:0":{"text":"왠지 수상한데요. 러스트 항에 후긴이 개인적으로 처리할 일이 뭐가 있을까요?","source_cn":"呼金怎么神神秘秘的，他在锈锚港还能有什么私事处理？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA8E79D4D42CB6F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:33:1220248022":{"text":"왠지 수상한데요. 러스트 항에 후긴이 개인적으로 처리할 일이 뭐가 있을까요?","source_cn":"呼金怎么神神秘秘的，他在锈锚港还能有什么私事处理？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA8E79D4D42CB6F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1220248023:1":{"text":"네, 어차피 내일 소니아의 사무실에서 만나기로 했으니 기다려 봐요!","source_cn":"嗯，反正明天还会在索尼娅的办公室见面！那就等等吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22B5AAC57EF9CA7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:33:0:1":{"text":"내일이면 알게 될 거야","source_cn":"明天就知道了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x92809ABD21967AD7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"내일이면 알게 될 거야","female":"내일이면 알게 될 거야","variant_male_record_index":"66538","variant_female_record_index":"66539","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:33:1:2":{"text":"나도 궁금해","source_cn":"我也很好奇","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDD4EF9BDCF89CC49","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"나도 궁금해","female":"나도 궁금해","variant_male_record_index":"66540","variant_female_record_index":"66541","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:27:0:1":{"text":"한 번 둘러보니, 느낌이 어때?","source_cn":"转了一圈，感想如何？","stat